{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25470","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 西园 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 西园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西园最多趣，永日自忘归。\n石濑流清浅，风岑澹翠微。\n晓翻红药艳，晴袅碧潭辉。\n独望娟娟月，宵分半掩扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25470.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25470","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}